    <!--
        v19.0.1.2.0 — Pre-seed every master table with the SAME values
        + same `code` strings the v1.1.x Selection enums used. The
        Python rules (kanban color, sort priority, automation
        transitions) all key off `code`, so upgrading from 1.1.x to
        1.2.0 changes the storage type without changing behaviour.
        Admins can rename the `name` freely afterwards.
    -->

